de (multiple languages) or independently, average visiting time is 90 minutes.\\n\\nYou can opt for a vodka tasting at the end.\\n\\nPrices range from 49-79zł.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15359\",\"d4\",1240,1622,\"To check out all options, tour times and prices visit their website: \\n\\nYou can get to the Museum by taxi or by taking tram no 4 or 22 – getting off at Fabryczna stop.\\n\\nMuseum is open from 2pm till 8pm (closed on Monday)\\n\\nKraków, ul. Fabryczna 13\\n\\n24th Great Dragon Parade\\n\\n06-06-2025Join us for the 24th Great Dragon Parade – one of the most spectacular open-air events in Poland!\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s15360\",\"d4\",1622,2017,\"Craft Fair on Kraków's Main Market Square\\n\\n23-05-2025We invite you to the unique Craft Fair on the Main Market Square in Kraków, where tradition is brought to life through handmade crafts.\\n\\nAbakanowicz. No rules. Sculptures in Wawel's Gardens\\n\\n07-05-2025Od 24 kwietnia w renesansowym ogrodzie Zamku Królewskiego na Wawelu można oglądać 14 plenerowych rzeźb najwybitniejszej polskiej rzeźbiarki. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s16045\",\"d5\",0,178,\"---\\ntitle: Panagra Timeline 1928 to 1949\\ndate: 2023-07-02\\n---\\nPanagra Timeline 1928 to 1949\\n\\nPAN AMERICAN-GRACE AIRWAYS PANAGRA\\n\\nTIMELINE\\n\\n1928 to 1949\\n\\n1920 to 1929\\n\\nJune 1928\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s16046\",\"d5\",178,501,\"Pan American Airways Corporation, originally known as Aviation Corporation of the Americas is formed for the purpose of finding capital for its primary subsidiary Pan American World Airways to bid on US Foreign Air Mail contracts for carrying mail between the US Mainland and Latin America, and specifically South America. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s16047\",\"d5\",501,832,\"The contracts were soon to be announced by the US Postmaster General pursuant to the Foreign Air Mail Act of 1928. Pan American correctly believed that it was best suited to operate under any contracts that might be awarded\\n\\nMay and July 1928\\n\\nPan American is awarded three Foreign Air Mail contracts for service to Latin America. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s16048\",\"d5\",832,1165,\"Pan American was awarded the contract for Foreign Air Mail Route (FAM) No. 5 for service between Miami and Panama in the Canal Zone. Interestingly, Pan American had already strategically decided that if it received FAM 5 then it would ask for extension services beyond the Canal Zone to and along the Western Coast of South America. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s16049\",\"d5\",1165,1555,\"The New York-based airline had also promulgated operating rights into Colombia, Panama, Ecuador and Peru, and had also purchased sufficient aircraft to operate the route system.\\n\\nPhoto: Captain Charles A. Lindbergh flew the inaugural Pan American World Airways flight from Miami to Cristobal, Panama, on February 4, 1929. The Sikorsky S-38 amphibian was used for the historic first flight. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s16050\",\"d5\",1555,1900,\"Copyright, Pan American World Airways Systems, Inc.\\n\\nAugust 1, 1928\\n\\nPan American and W. R. Grace purchase its first aircraft, a new Fairchild FC-2 monoplane, registered in the United States as NC6853 and dubbed Ship P-1, which featured a cabin for four passengers and was powered by a Wright Whirlwind engine with an output of 220 horsepower.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13299\",\"d1\",1723,1953,\"20-03-2025Right next to the main building of Antique Apartments, at Plac Szczepański 4, you will find the Society of Friends of Fine Arts in Kraków. Founded in 1854, it was the first institution of its kind in Polish territories. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13300\",\"d1\",1953,2204,\"Its exhibition halls have been the debut stage for some of Poland's most outstanding artists, including Jan Matejko, Julian Fałat, Włodzimierz Tetmajer, Stanisław Wyspiański, Józef Mehoffer, Jacek Malczewski, and many others.\\n\\nMorskie Oko Restaurant\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13301\",\"d1\",2204,2513,\"28-02-2025If you wanto to try polish traditional food we reccomend Morskie Oko restaurant, located just across from Antique Apartments main building, at Plac Szczepański 8.\\n\\nTrip to Chochołowskie Thermal Baths\\n\\n06-02-2025On winter days, we highly recommend a relaxing trip to the Chochołowskie Thermal Baths. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13302\",\"d1\",2513,2896,\"Designed for recreation and relaxation, this is the largest thermal pool complex in the Podhale region\\n\\nJapanese Woodcuts from the Collection of the National Museum in Krakow\\n\\n24-01-2025The exhibition of woodcuts by Kitagawa Utamaro is a unique presentation of masterpieces of Japanese art from the collection of the National Museum in Krakow.\\n\\nExhibition of Acquisitions 2020–2024\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13303\",\"d1\",2896,3189,\"08-01-2025This exhibition is dedicated to the most valuable and historically and artistically significant artifacts acquired by the Museum of Krakow over the past five years.\\n\\nHappy New Year 2025\\n\\n31-12-2024May the New Year bring you peace, joy, and happiness.\\n\\nCaroling in the Market Square\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13304\",\"d1\",3189,3458,\"20-12-2024The most beautiful Polish carols and pastorals will be sung during the 90th Kraków Singing Lesson, \\\"Carols to Sing at Home.\\\" The communal caroling will take place in the Main Market Square tomorrow, December 21, at 5:00 PM.\\n\\nKraków Nativity Scene Exhibition\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13305\",\"d1\",3458,3841,\"13-12-2024As per tradition, the nativity scenes will be showcased to the public from December 9, 2024, to March 2, 2025, in a post-competition exhibition at the Krzysztofory Palace. The Nativity Scene Exhibition can be visited Monday through Sunday, from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM. The Krzysztofory Palace is located near Antique Apartments – on the corner ofMain Market Square at No. 35.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13306\",\"d1\",3841,4228,\"Christmas Market at Wolnica Square\\n\\n06-12-2024We recommend visiting the atmospheric Christmas Market in the Kazimierz district, held at Wolnica Square, the heart of this historic part of Kraków. The market will take place from December 2 to December 15, 2024.\\n\\nChristmas Market 2024\\n\\n22-11-2024The Christmas Market in Kraków begins on November 29, 2024, and runs until January 1, 2025.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13307\",\"d1\",4228,4620,\"7th Artists and Designers Market - Nówka Sztuka\\n\\n05-11-2024This weekend 9th and 10th of November, as a part of bigger project named: \\\"A Thing for Art – Design in Kraków\\\" the seventh edition of the Brand New Art Artists and Designers Fair will take place at the Palace of Art, right next to Antique Apartments at Plac Szczepański 4.\\n\\nGlassFest Kraków – the Festival of Science and Technology\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13308\",\"d1\",4620,4911,\"24-10-2024The Łukasiewicz Research Network – Institute of Ceramics and Building Materials, together with the Małopolska Science Center Cogiteon, invites you to events within the framework of GlassFest Kraków – the Festival of Science and Technology.\\n\\nArt Exhibition works by Olga Pawłowska\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13309\",\"d1\",4911,5308,\"08-10-2024Visitors are invited to the painting exhibition by Olga Pawłowska, titled 30 Beats Per Minute, which can be seen at Bunkier Sztuki, just around the corner from Antique Apartments.\\n\\nBreakfast at Antique Apartments\\n\\n13-09-2024Delicious breakfasts prepared by Charlotte Bistro will be delivered directly to your apartment, or you can pick them up at the reception.\\n\\nSILENCE Music Festival\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13310\",\"d1\",5308,5658,\"30-08-2024Today, August 30th, the SILENCE Music Festival will begin. This year's edition will be inaugurated with the performance \\\"(A)Insomnia,\\\" a new incarnation of Johann Sebastian Bach's \\\"Goldberg Variations.\\\" We will hear a live continuation of this piece, written by artificial intelligence, simultaneously at the Kijów Cinema in Krakow and St. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13311\",\"d1\",5658,5993,\"Thomas Church in Leipzig, over the grave of the famous composer.\\n\\nSummer Jazz Festival Kraków\\n\\n23-08-2024The 29th edition of the Summer Jazz Festival Kraków is ongoing until September 1st. This is the largest festival of its kind in Poland, attracting around 50,000 attendees across its concerts.\\n\\nThe BNP Paribas Green Film Festival\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13312\",\"d1\",5993,6249,\"15-08-2024The BNP Paribas Green Film Festival is an international ecological film festival that has been held in Kraków since 2018. It is the only festival of its kind in Poland and one of the largest ecological film festivals in the world.\\n\\nBunkier Cafe\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13313\",\"d1\",6249,6640,\"19-07-2024Bunkier Cafe is an iconic cafe located just around the corner from our reception, at the Bunkier Sztuki Contemporary Art Gallery, on Krakow's Planty at Plac Szczepański 3a. The entire gallery and cafe have just undergone a thorough renovation and have reopened to visitors.\\n\\nTap water in Kraków\\n\\n12-07-2024In Krakow, it's the height of summer, and we can enjoy sunny and hot days. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13314\",\"d1\",6640,6964,\"However, it's important to remember to stay properly hydrated. In Krakow, you can safely drink tap water without boiling it. Tap water contains minerals such as calcium, magnesium, potassium, and sodium.\\n\\nThe 33rd edition of the Jewish Culture\\n\\n21-06-2024Festival begins on Sunday, June 23 and will last untill end of June. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13315\",\"d1\",6964,7340,\"The festival will take place throughout almost the entire Kazimierz district, with the FKŻ tent on Józefa Street and daily concerts at the Museum of Engineering and Technology.\\n\\nTripAdvisor's Travelers' Choice Awards 2024\\n\\n17-06-2024We are delighted to announce that we have been awarded in TripAdvisor's Travelers' Choice Awards 2024\\n\\n23rd Great Dragon Parade 8-9 June 2024\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13316\",\"d1\",7340,7607,\"07-06-2024This weekend, we invite you to the 23rd Great Dragon Parade. The spectacle will take place at the foot of Wawel Castle, in the beautiful bend of the Vistula River. It's worth arriving a bit earlier to secure a comfortable spot.\\n\\nBotanical Garden in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13317\",\"d1\",7607,7827,\"30-05-2024The small Botanical Garden of the Jagiellonian University is located almost in the very center of Krakow, a 10-minute walk from the Main Market Square at 27 Kopernika Street.\\n\\nThe World of Hans Zimmer concert\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13318\",\"d1\",7827,8139,\"10-05-2024On the upcoming Sunday, May 12th, a special concert \\\"The World of Hans Zimmer – A New Dimension\\\" will take place at the Tauron Arena, during which the world-renowned composer will arrange a completely new selection of scores, captivating music connoisseurs in the process.\\n\\nMastercard OFF CAMERA 2024\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13319\",\"d1\",8139,8471,\"23-04-2024As every year, we will welcome Mastercard OFF CAMERA to Plac Szczepański from April 26th to May 5th as part of the 17th edition of the International Independent Cinema Festival Mastercard OFF CAMERA!\\n\\n\\\"Food in Art\\\" Exhibition in MOCAK\\n\\n12-04-2024Food in Art is the 11th exhibition in MOCAK's 'Civilization in Art' series. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13320\",\"d1\",8471,8767,\"The series explores topics such as history, sports, economics, crime, medicine, nature, and politics, allowing us to see these issues through the eyes of artists and from their individual perspectives.\\n\\nNew cafe EL&N London opened in Kraków\\n\\n05-04-2024In Krakow, the EL&N London café has opened. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13321\",\"d1\",8767,8986,\"This iconic pink venue, with branches worldwide, entices with deliciously presented food and extraordinary interiors.\\n\\nEaster Fair 2024 at Market Square\\n\\n21-03-2024The Easter Fair in Krakow kicks off on March 21, 2024. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13322\",\"d1\",8986,9378,\"Stalls with various handicrafts, especially products related to Easter such as palms, floral arrangements, Easter baskets, and painted eggs, will be waiting for you in the unique setting of the Main Market Square in Krakow. There will also be stalls with traditional Polish dishes, so you'll surely be able to taste something delicious.\\n\\nRegulated Modernity: Modernism in the PRL Exhibition\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13323\",\"d1\",9378,9743,\"13-03-2024The exhibition focuses on various aspects of regulation during the Polish People's Republic (PRL) period. It presents 360 exhibits from various areas of life, art, and culture, including objects of artistic craftsmanship, fashion, technology, as well as publications in the form of books and magazines.\\n\\nPermanent Exhibition at Wawel - Porcelain Cabinet\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13324\",\"d1\",9743,10143,\"20-02-2024A new permanent exhibition titled \\\"Porcelain Cabinet\\\" has found its place at the Royal Castle on Wawel.\\n\\nPolish Doughnut Day\\n\\n08-02-2024\\\"Fat Thursday\\\" is the last Thursday before Lent, and Poles celebrate the final days of the carnival during this time. On this day, sweet pastries dominate the tables – in accordance with tradition, these are doughnuts (pączki) and angel wings (chrust).\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13325\",\"d1\",10143,10515,\"Japan on the Threshold of Modernity Captured in Photography - Exhibition\\n\\n02-02-2024The National Museum in Krakow invites you to an exhibition that explores the history, specificity, and symbolism of traditional Japanese clothing. It also aims to showcase the development of Japanese design thinking and the modernization processes it underwent.\\n\\nBanksy Museum in Kraków\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13326\",\"d1\",10515,10890,\"22-01-2024In the unique setting of postindustrial space at Kraków's Kazimierz district you can admire over 150 reproductions of works of Banksy – one of the most misterious artists of our times.\\n\\nXplore Dome: Travel Salad\\n\\n05-01-2024It is a unique multimedia exposition that allows you to Travel around the world thanks to advanced AR technology.\\n\\n\\\"Christmas Time! Concert\\\"\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13327\",\"d1\",10890,11187,\"27-12-2023At the \\\"Christmas Time! Concert\\\" you will have a chance to listen to polish carols sang by some of the best polish singers accompanied by Royal Symphony Orchestra.\\n\\nMerry Christmas!\\n\\n22-12-2023We wish you a merry Christmass and a Happy New Year!\\n\\nGuided Tour – Kraków's Nativity Scenes\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13328\",\"d1\",11187,11585,\"15-12-2023You can join guided tour to admire beautiful Krakow's Nativity Sceenes located in various locations of the Old Town.\\n\\nKrakow Christmas Market\\n\\n21-11-2023Krakow Christmas Market has been shortlisted by CNN as one of the most popular and best Christmas markets in Europe this year, so it is definatelly worth visiting. It starts on the 24th of November and finishes on the 1st of January.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13329\",\"d1\",11585,11967,\"Kraków's Museums Open Day\\n\\n13-11-2023On the 19 th of November yet another edition of Kraków's Museums Open Day will take place. It gives you a chance to visit 55 of Kraków's great museums and art galeries, that will not only present their standard exhibitions, but also organize special events for that day, such as workshops, multimedia presentations and guided tours.\\n\\n20th Prof. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s13330\",\"d1\",11967,12343,\"Jan Jargoń International Organ All Souls Festival\\n\\n03-11-2023The 20th Jan Jargoń International Organ All Souls Festival will take place from 28th of October till 9th of November. Aclaimed organists from Holand, Germany, Poland and Ukrain will perform in churches around Old Town of Kraków. The repertoire will range from the early Renaissance to contemporary improvisations.\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13331\",\"d1\",12343,12665,\"68th Kraków All Souls \\\"Zaduszki\\\" Jazz Festival\\n\\n27-10-202368th Kraków All Souls \\\"Zaduszki\\\" Jazz Festival will take place between 25 and 29 October 2023. This is the oldest Jazz festiwal in Europe, dating back to 1954. It is a perfect oportunity to celebrate Jazz music in a unique setting of Kraków.\\n\\nMuseum of Illusions\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s13332\",\"d1\",12665,13046,\"10-10-2023The Museum of Illusions is a space where illusions meet scientific inventions and the arts: physics and optics are displayed together with mysterious artwork and classical riddles.\\n\\n19th Cultural Borderlands Fair\\n\\n29-09-2023Untill 3rd of October you can visit Cultural Borderlands Fair at the Small Market Square next to St. Mary's Basilica.\\n\\nMUFO Museum of Photography\\n\\n\",\"document\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"learning institution that fits all given criteria\",\"time_scope\":\"as of 2023\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"41218\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"26574\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"96538\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"84855\",\"time_metadata\":{}},\"d5\":{\"doc_id\":\"36617\",\"time_metadata\":{}}},\"source_span_columns\":[\"id\",\"doc_id\",\"start\",\"end\",\"text\",\"source_role\",\"source_message_indices\"]}"
